First install the package:
npm
npm install @originkit/avatars

Then draw it as
A live avatar
import { Avatar } from "@originkit/avatars/react";

export function UserAvatar() {
  return <Avatar style="gummies" name="Juju" overrides={{"body":0.85,"face":0.2083,"color:ink":1397842}} size={48} />;
}

It blinks, follows the pointer and reacts to taps, as in the studio. On the server, and until the page runs, it shows the still. Turn motion off with follow={false} or animate={false}.
To give every user their own, seed it with something that doesn't change, such as their id:
<Avatar style="gummies" name={user.id} />
